nt to heritage, innovation, and religious tourism under Vision 2030.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-saudi-arabias-in-the-prophets-steps-over-one-million-worldwide-registered-ahead-of-launch/articleshow/122960838.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-saudi-arabias-in-the-prophets-steps-over-one-million-worldwide-registered-ahead-of-launch/articleshow/122960838.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T02:02:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122961020,imgsize-651112.cms"/></item><item><title>Julian Brown 'disappearance' mystery: Mother says he's safe but can't disclose his location, details. Here's what happened</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122960998.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/julian-brown-disappearance-mystery-mother-says-hes-safe-but-cant-disclose-his-location-details-heres-what-happened/articleshow/122960998.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/julian-brown-disappearance-mystery-mother-says-hes-safe-but-cant-disclose-his-location-details-heres-what-happened/articleshow/122960998.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T01:53:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122960995,imgsize-48276.cms"/></item><item><title>London mayor Sadiq Khan 'delighted' after Donald Trump calls him 'nasty': 'He'd see how...'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122960720.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/london-