 may provide clues on a likely Trump-Xi meeting</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122960309.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-china-tariff-talks-may-provide-clues-on-a-likely-trump-xi-meeting/articleshow/122960309.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-china-tariff-talks-may-provide-clues-on-a-likely-trump-xi-meeting/articleshow/122960309.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T00:30:15+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122960317,imgsize-55302.cms"/></item><item><title>French PM says US-EU trade deal a 'dark day' for Europe</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122960274.cms" /&gt;Following the EU and US trade agreement, France is strongly advocating for tariff retaliation, warning of political weakening if Europe doesn't respond. PM Bayrou criticized the deal's 15% tariffs on European imports, while Minister Haddad suggested countermeasures like taxing US digital services. Despite France's stance, other European leaders, including those from Germany and Italy, welcomed the agreement, averting a potential trade war.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/french-pm-says-us-eu-trade-deal-a-dark-day-for-europe/articleshow/122960274.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/french-pm-says-us-eu-trade-deal-a-dark-day-for-europe/articleshow/122960274.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T00:27:51+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122960298,imgsize-578673.cms"/></item><item><title>Trump: World tariff would be somewhere in 15-20% range</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src=